  openingDialogues:
  - speakerName: Alano
    line: 'Hey, you''re here.

      Today is your first day at work, so there are
      a few things I need to mention to you beforehand...'
    optionTexts: []
    nextNodeIndex0: 1
    nextNodeIndex1: 1
  - speakerName: Alano
    line: This place is Nocturne Club, where customers come <color=red>seeking emotional
      support</color> . This is exactly what attracts our guests.
    optionTexts: []
    nextNodeIndex0: 2
    nextNodeIndex1: 2
  - speakerName: Alano
    line: You need to <color=red>observe their moods</color> and adjust the drinks
      <color=red>according to their words</color>. The bartending instructions have
      been written in the brochure.
    optionTexts: []
    nextNodeIndex0: 3
    nextNodeIndex1: 3
  - speakerName: Alano
    line: 'Remember, mood is the key to serving the right drink. \n

      Alright,
      start your work! '
    optionTexts:
    - Got it!
    - Let's start!
    nextNodeIndex0: -1
    nextNodeIndex1: -1
